  41. ask 0->2 granted forgetful
  42. recovery_timeout 0
  43. decide 0 term 2 (4 grants, 3 forgetful)   <- memory
  result: memory; at most 2 voters forgetful at once
  result: memory; at most 2 voters forgetful at once
